device=cuda:0
Protocol: CONTROLLED GT+smooth-jitter local prior; current-frame GT centres the local SAT search window.
3-frame recurrent state -> v/a + heading/turn-rate -> heading-aware second-order inertial polynomial -> fixed visual observation -> GRU -> robust constrained route-coordinate Kalman -> optional final MS -> final XY.
Evaluation intentionally does not solve global acquisition/re-localization: every frame receives a bounded GT-centered local prior.
Estimated position may be corrected backward after an over-prediction; physical forward intent is represented by non-negative route velocity.
